 treating pipe-borne water, and loss of fishing livelihoods. Control measures: enforcing by-laws and pollution penalties with regular monitoring of water bodies, and educating communities while providing proper refuse collection so waste is not dumped into rivers; buffer-zone tree planting along riverbanks is also creditable.' AND e.marking_rubric IS NULL AND e.required_points IS '["At least three distinct causes explained","At least three distinct effects explained","Two practical control measures suggested"]' AND e.optional_points IS '["Named Ghanaian context such as galamsey-affected rivers","Links between cause, effect and chosen control measure"]' AND e.ai_grading_enabled IS '1')) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END;
